{
  "source": {
    "source_id": "3001121",
    "title": "Letter 121",
    "breadcrumbs": "Home > Fathers of the Church > Letters of St. Jerome > Letter 121",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p0001",
        "kind": "h1",
        "text": "Letter 121",
        "scripture": [],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0002",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "<strong>To Algasia</strong>",
        "scripture": [],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0003",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "Jerome writes to a lady of Gaul named Algasia to answer eleven questions which she had submitted to him. They were as follows:—",
        "scripture": [],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0004",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "(1) How is Luke 7:18, 19, to be reconciled with John i. 36?",
        "scripture": [
          "joh 1:36"
        ],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0005",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "(2) What is the meaning of Matt. xii. 20?",
        "scripture": [
          "mat 12:20"
        ],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0006",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "(3) And of Matt. xvi. 24?",
        "scripture": [
          "mat 16:24"
        ],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0007",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "(4) And of Matthew 24:19, 20?",
        "scripture": [],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0008",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "(5) And of Luke ix. 53?",
        "scripture": [
          "luk 9:53"
        ],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0009",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "(6) What is the meaning of the parable of the unjust steward?",
        "scripture": [],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0010",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "(7) What is the meaning of Rom. v. 7?",
        "scripture": [
          "rom 5:7"
        ],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0011",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "(8) And of Rom. vii. 8?",
        "scripture": [
          "rom 7:8"
        ],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0012",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "(9) And of Rom. ix. 3?",
        "scripture": [
          "rom 9:3"
        ],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0013",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "(10) And of Col. ii. 18?",
        "scripture": [
          "col 2:18"
        ],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0014",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "(11) And of 2 Thes. ii. 3?",
        "scripture": [
          "2th 2:3"
        ],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "p0015",
        "kind": "p",
        "text": "The date of the letter is 406 A.D.",
        "scripture": [],
        "style": "",
        "notes": []
      }
    ],
    "source_note": "Source. Translated by W.H. Fremantle, G. Lewis and W.G. Martley. From Nicene and Post-Nicene Fathers, Second Series, Vol. 6. Edited by Philip Schaff and Henry Wace. (Buffalo, NY: Christian Literature Publishing Co., 1893.) Revised and edited for New Advent by Kevin Knight. <http://www.newadvent.org/fathers/3001121.htm>.",
    "metadata": {
      "srctrans": "Translated by W.H. Fremantle, G. Lewis and W.G. Martley.",
      "srcwork": "Nicene and Post-Nicene Fathers, Second Series",
      "srcvolume": "Vol. 6.",
      "srced": "Edited by Philip Schaff and Henry Wace.",
      "srcpublisher": "Buffalo, NY: Christian Literature Publishing Co.,",
      "srcyear": "1893.",
      "srcurl": "<http://www.newadvent.org/fathers/3001121.htm>."
    }
  },
  "latex": {
    "p0001": "第一二一号书信",
    "p0002": "\\Emph{致\\Person{阿尔加西亚}}",
    "p0003": "\\Person{热罗尼莫}写信给一位\\Place{高卢}的女士，名叫\\Person{阿尔加西亚}，以回答她向他提出的十一个问题。如下：——",
    "p0004": "(1) 如何将\\BibleRef{路 7:18-19}与\\BibleRef{若 1:36}调和？",
    "p0005": "(2) \\BibleRef{玛 12:20}的含义是什么？",
    "p0006": "(3) \\BibleRef{玛 16:24}的含义是什么？",
    "p0007": "(4) \\BibleRef{玛 24:19-20}的含义是什么？",
    "p0008": "(5) \\BibleRef{路 9:53}的含义是什么？",
    "p0009": "(6) 不义管家的比喻有何含义？",
    "p0010": "(7) \\BibleRef{罗 5:7}的含义是什么？",
    "p0011": "(8) \\BibleRef{罗 7:8}的含义是什么？",
    "p0012": "(9) \\BibleRef{罗 9:3}的含义是什么？",
    "p0013": "(10) \\BibleRef{哥 2:18}的含义是什么？",
    "p0014": "(11) \\BibleRef{得后 2:3}的含义是什么？",
    "p0015": "这封信的日期是公元406年。"
  }
}